    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/95347142faf7dfc4cb6d3947ab004520.poster.avif?t=1742957145\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/95347142faf7dfc4cb6d3947ab004520.webm?t=1742957145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/95347142faf7dfc4cb6d3947ab004520.mp4?t=1742957145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture on an\u00a0enchanting adventure in a picturesque tilt shifted world. Explore dungeons, aquire powerful items, and fight bosses! But why? Well, this\u00a0whimsical world is not all what it seems to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/3323ae0ac9820fb3b6eb9be855a763c8.avif?t=1742957145\" width=616 height=67 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant and stylized world, ranging from a grand port city in the west to a dangerous desert in the east, with a snow-covered mountain to the north and a lush, deep forest to the south</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into four temples and several dungeons inbetween to solve puzzles, acquire powerful items, and defeat bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/6fcdb55ebbc1d2a39113b450f279414e.avif?t=1742957145\" width=616 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Save the world from a\u00a0catastrophic event! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the world with a stylish locomotive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character to your liking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/ac81e7923b41083b5bfcee69c83fba5b.poster.avif?t=1742957145\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/ac81e7923b41083b5bfcee69c83fba5b.webm?t=1742957145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/ac81e7923b41083b5bfcee69c83fba5b.mp4?t=1742957145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full day / night cycle and various dynamic weather!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/fd62d41dc3ed56d4965c85995f456d82.poster.avif?t=1742957145\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/fd62d41dc3ed56d4965c85995f456d82.webm?t=1742957145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/fd62d41dc3ed56d4965c85995f456d82.mp4?t=1742957145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is the first iteration of the Steam store page. It will continue to be updated along the development!</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/95347142faf7dfc4cb6d3947ab004520.poster.avif?t=1742957145\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/95347142faf7dfc4cb6d3947ab004520.webm?t=1742957145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/95347142faf7dfc4cb6d3947ab004520.mp4?t=1742957145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture on an\u00a0enchanting adventure in a picturesque tilt shifted world. Explore dungeons, aquire powerful items, and fight bosses! But why? Well, this\u00a0whimsical world is not all what it seems to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/3323ae0ac9820fb3b6eb9be855a763c8.avif?t=1742957145\" width=616 height=67 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant and stylized world, ranging from a grand port city in the west to a dangerous desert in the east, with a snow-covered mountain to the north and a lush, deep forest to the south</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into four temples and several dungeons inbetween to solve puzzles, acquire powerful items, and defeat bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/6fcdb55ebbc1d2a39113b450f279414e.avif?t=1742957145\" width=616 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Save the world from a\u00a0catastrophic event! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the world with a stylish locomotive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character to your liking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/ac81e7923b41083b5bfcee69c83fba5b.poster.avif?t=1742957145\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/ac81e7923b41083b5bfcee69c83fba5b.webm?t=1742957145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/ac81e7923b41083b5bfcee69c83fba5b.mp4?t=1742957145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full day / night cycle and various dynamic weather!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/fd62d41dc3ed56d4965c85995f456d82.poster.avif?t=1742957145\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/fd62d41dc3ed56d4965c85995f456d82.webm?t=1742957145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219390/extras/fd62d41dc3ed56d4965c85995f456d82.mp4?t=1742957145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is the first iteration of the Steam store page. It will continue to be updated along the development!</i></p>",
